# P38 authored ruins: independent objectives, clues and completion records
gtsr.ruin.ending.switchhouse=Connect the three circuits in their marked order to open the cache. The surviving record reveals that the official line stopped the rescue train.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_switchhouse=Witness: Switchhouse
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_switchhouse.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.pumping_house=Restore the valve chain to unseal the service cache. A crossed-out supply order reads on its back: do not send water to the empty city.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_pumping_house=Witness: Pumping House
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_pumping_house.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.workers_lodging=The official account says everyone left. The dishes and workbadge abandoned beside the beds tell a different ending.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_workers_lodging=Witness: Workers' Shelter
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_workers_lodging.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.shore_crane=The final crate was never dispatched. The driver kept it for a family whose names remain on the cabin desk.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_shore_crane=Witness: Shore Crane
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_shore_crane.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.cold_altar=The cold-ash choice opens the rear cache. The final shutdown was a deliberate act to hide the ember from an order.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_cold_altar=Witness: Cold Altar
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_cold_altar.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.trench_infirmary=The medic crossed out every allegiance mark. The last dose went to a wounded soldier from the opposing trench.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_trench_infirmary=Witness: Trench Infirmary
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_trench_infirmary.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.ash_crematory=Defeat all three guards and reach the ash cache. The final space on the list eventually took the recorder’s own name.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_ash_crematory=Witness: Ash Crematory
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_ash_crematory.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.rift_observatory=The aligned mirrors reveal a cache. The final report records no rift: only the date the observer stood here.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_rift_observatory=Witness: Rift Observatory
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_rift_observatory.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.weighbridge=Defeat the three raiders and reach the duty cabinet. The missing grain was quietly diverted to unlisted refugees.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_weighbridge=Witness: Weighbridge
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_weighbridge.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.valve_yard=The cache holds an order to lock every safety valve. The engineer who left this test was the only one who refused to sign it.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_valve_yard=Witness: Valve Yard
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_valve_yard.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.archivist_kiosk=Their dates match; their endings do not. The backup preserves names the official archive erased.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_archivist_kiosk=Witness: Archivist Kiosk
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_archivist_kiosk.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.sap_collector=Production called the trees fuel. The service book demanded their protection; its last keeper closed the valve.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_sap_collector=Witness: Sap Collector
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_sap_collector.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.mire_boardwalk=The old retreat arrow pointed deeper into the mire. Someone corrected it and led the last group along the supported boards.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_mire_boardwalk=Witness: Mire Boardwalk
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_mire_boardwalk.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.pilgrim_arch=Defeat all three and reach the far side. When passes became warrants, a keeper finally let the undocumented through.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_pilgrim_arch=Witness: Pilgrim Arch
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_pilgrim_arch.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.signal_bridge=Restoring the sequence opens the bridgehead cache. A corrupted call once brought artillery instead of aid.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_signal_bridge=Witness: Signal Bridge
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_signal_bridge.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.fungus_cellar=Defeat the three guards and reach the purification bench. The keeper kept counting sacks long after they ceased to be food.
