achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_boiler_chapel.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.broken_aqueduct=The water never stopped; it bypassed the empty city. By the final repair, its list of residents no longer changed.
