gtsr.ruin.ending.gear_garden=Defeat all three and reach the core cache. The last mechanic converted the workstation into a garden and called watering it maintenance.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_gear_garden=Witness: Gear Garden
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_gear_garden.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.ending.expedition_camp=The return list is much shorter. The final line on the map marks a way home, not a new frontier.
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_expedition_camp=Witness: Expedition Camp
achievement.gtsr.ruinComplete_expedition_camp.desc=Complete the site objectives and reach its final cache.
gtsr.ruin.memory.workers_lodging.0=Shift board: every crew has evacuated. Follow the beds to the shelter upstairs.
gtsr.ruin.clue.workers_lodging.0=Shift board: every crew has evacuated. Follow the beds to the shelter upstairs.
gtsr.ruin.memory.workers_lodging.1=Shelter record: nobody would be the last to leave. A forgotten workbadge lies beneath the table.
gtsr.ruin.clue.workers_lodging.1=Shelter record: nobody would be the last to leave. A forgotten workbadge lies beneath the table.
gtsr.ruin.memory.shore_crane.0=Dock manifest: the last crate never left. Follow the driver’s list to the cabin.
gtsr.ruin.clue.shore_crane.0=Dock manifest: the last crate never left. Follow the driver’s list to the cabin.
gtsr.ruin.memory.shore_crane.1=Cabin note: leave the crate on the loading platform off the official line.
gtsr.ruin.clue.shore_crane.1=Cabin note: leave the crate on the loading platform off the official line.
gtsr.ruin.memory.shore_crane.2=Crate inscription: if you return, this is the last thing I could leave for you.
gtsr.ruin.clue.shore_crane.2=Crate inscription: if you return, this is the last thing I could leave for you.
gtsr.ruin.memory.trench_infirmary.0=Treatment room: ask no allegiance. The remaining dose is in the rear medicine cabinet.
gtsr.ruin.clue.trench_infirmary.0=Treatment room: ask no allegiance. The remaining dose is in the rear medicine cabinet.
gtsr.ruin.memory.trench_infirmary.1=Medicine record: give it to the soldier from the opposing trench. Someone must remember that we still saved lives.
gtsr.ruin.clue.trench_infirmary.1=Medicine record: give it to the soldier from the opposing trench. Someone must remember that we still saved lives.
gtsr.ruin.memory.archivist_kiosk.0=Damaged archive: no survivors. Yet the backup room was propped open from within.
gtsr.ruin.clue.archivist_kiosk.0=Damaged archive: no survivors. Yet the backup room was propped open from within.
gtsr.ruin.memory.archivist_kiosk.1=Handwritten backup: the official pages forbid names, so I preserved them here.
gtsr.ruin.clue.archivist_kiosk.1=Handwritten backup: the official pages forbid names, so I preserved them here.
gtsr.ruin.memory.sap_collector.0=Extraction log: reduce the draw; the roots no longer heal. Inspect the root-side station next.
gtsr.ruin.clue.sap_collector.0=Extraction log: reduce the draw; the roots no longer heal. Inspect the root-side station next.
gtsr.ruin.memory.sap_collector.1=Root service log: main valve closed today. The trees deserve to grow without feeding another furnace.
gtsr.ruin.clue.sap_collector.1=Root service log: main valve closed today. The trees deserve to grow without feeding another furnace.
gtsr.ruin.memory.mire_boardwalk.0=Entrance mark: the arrow points into water. Follow the supported boardwalk to the turn.
gtsr.ruin.clue.mire_boardwalk.0=Entrance mark: the arrow points into water. Follow the supported boardwalk to the turn.
gtsr.ruin.memory.mire_boardwalk.1=Turning mark: the old direction is crossed out. Follow the new mark to the water gauge shelter.
gtsr.ruin.clue.mire_boardwalk.1=Turning mark: the old direction is crossed out. Follow the new mark to the water gauge shelter.
gtsr.ruin.memory.mire_boardwalk.2=Gauge shelter: I brought them back. Nobody remained where the first arrow had pointed.
gtsr.ruin.clue.mire_boardwalk.2=Gauge shelter: I brought them back. Nobody remained where the first arrow had pointed.
gtsr.ruin.memory.broken_aqueduct.0=Inlet waterline: this once supplied the city. The service room beneath the break holds the diversion log.
gtsr.ruin.clue.broken_aqueduct.0=Inlet waterline: this once supplied the city. The service room beneath the break holds the diversion log.
gtsr.ruin.memory.broken_aqueduct.1=Diversion log: no answer from the city. Let the water reach something still growing.
gtsr.ruin.clue.broken_aqueduct.1=Diversion log: no answer from the city. Let the water reach something still growing.
gtsr.ruin.memory.expedition_camp.0=Map tent: returning crews follow the campfire. The final supply entry awaits those still missing.
gtsr.ruin.clue.expedition_camp.0=Map tent: returning crews follow the campfire. The final supply entry awaits those still missing.
gtsr.ruin.memory.expedition_camp.1=Campfire record: advance no further. Leave the remaining food on the return path; wait for the last traveller.
gtsr.ruin.clue.expedition_camp.1=Campfire record: advance no further. Leave the remaining food on the return path; wait for the last traveller.
gtsr.ruin.clue.switchhouse.0=Arrival I: connect this circuit before the return line. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.switchhouse.1=Return II: connect after the arrival lamp is lit. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.switchhouse.2=Rescue III: connect after the return circuit. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.pumping_house.0=Main pump: vent pressure and open the bypass before starting. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.pumping_house.1=Relief valve: the first step is to release stored pressure. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.pumping_house.2=Bypass: open after venting, then start the main pump. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.cold_altar.0=Soot furnace: dark ash bears no cold-ash mark. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.cold_altar.1=Cold-ash furnace: the pale mark matches the keeper's record. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.cold_altar.2=Rust furnace: red residue is not the recorded cold ash. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.rift_observatory.0=Near mirror: align first, then adjust the middle mirror. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.rift_observatory.1=Middle mirror: align after the near scale. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.rift_observatory.2=Far mirror: lock after near and middle alignment. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.valve_yard.0=Bypass pressure: 20. Leave this low-pressure route open. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.valve_yard.1=Main pressure: 80. Close this high-pressure valve. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.valve_yard.2=Secondary pressure: 60. This is the other high-pressure valve to close. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.signal_bridge.0=Bridge signal: the intact plate says tower, bridge, then road. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.signal_bridge.1=Road signal: this is the final return signal. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.signal_bridge.2=Tower signal: restore this lamp before the bridge and road. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.boiler_chapel.0=Master bell: sound last, after outer and inner bells. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.boiler_chapel.1=Inner bell: outer first, inner next, master last. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.boiler_chapel.2=Outer bell: begin here and proceed inward. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.resonant_station.0=Low resonator: clear the guards, then sound low, middle and high. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.resonant_station.1=Middle resonator: continue after the low note. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.resonant_station.2=High resonator: sound last to awaken the clock hall. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.fallen_foundry.0=Unloading line: clear its guards and close fuel supply. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.fallen_foundry.1=Furnace line: clear its guards and isolate pressure. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.fallen_foundry.2=Casting line: clear its guards and end the hall's preheat. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.subsided_factory.0=Pump conduit: clear the district and isolate its memory. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.subsided_factory.1=Vent conduit: clear the district and isolate transmission. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.subsided_factory.2=Hive conduit: clear the district and isolate the core's echo. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.boiler_shrine.0=First steam stage: clear guards and close the main valve. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.boiler_shrine.1=Second steam stage: clear guards and close the main valve. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.boiler_shrine.2=Third steam stage: clear guards and close the main valve. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.weaving_mill.0=Warp circuit: restore after clearing the yarn store. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.weaving_mill.1=Weft circuit: restore after clearing the loom hall. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.weaving_mill.2=Final feed relay: clear this district, then connect it after the receiving relay. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.weaving_mill.3=Final receiving relay: connect this first, then connect the feed relay. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.sniper_watch.0=First watch station: clear guards and align the instrument. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.sniper_watch.1=Second watch station: clear guards and align the instrument. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.sniper_watch.2=Third watch station: clear guards and align the instrument. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.mirror_barracks.0=West bridge gate: release after clearing the west wing. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.clue.mirror_barracks.1=East bridge gate: release after clearing the east wing. Sneak-right-click inspects; right-click operates.
gtsr.ruin.guardsRemain=The apparatus remains held by echoes. Clear this district first.
gtsr.ruin.accepted=The apparatus responds. Circuit progress is saved.
gtsr.ruin.retry=The order was wrong. The circuit reset; inspect its plates and try again.
gtsr.ruin.inspect=Sneak-right-click to inspect; right-click to operate.
